    "It has been {days} days since the licence was last confirmed online. Your licence is valid — connect to the internet, then press «Check now».",
  "licenceUi.checkinBodyNoCount":
    "The licence has not been confirmed online for a while. Your licence is valid — connect to the internet, then press «Check now».",
