  "securityReports.postPosting.gapDetail.reason":
    "No cancel or reverse path asks for a reason and no event records a `reason` field, so this column is always blank today. The fix is a mandatory reason on void and reversal, written into the audit event's details.",
  "securityReports.postPosting.gap.editedAfterPosting": "Editing a posted document",
  "securityReports.postPosting.gapDetail.editedAfterPosting":
    "There is no “edited after posting” event: a posted document is not edited, it is voided or reversed, and no before/after comparison of its lines is recorded. The report therefore shows voids and reversals only — it does not guess at an edit nobody recorded.",
  "securityReports.postPosting.gap.approvalOverride": "Approval-cycle override",
  "securityReports.postPosting.gapDetail.approvalOverride":
    "Changes to the approval configuration are recorded, but overriding an approval step on a specific document is not, so a post-posting change cannot be tied to an approval override.",

