  "securityReports.afterHours.gapDetail.workDayStart":
    "Company settings define the weekend days and the length of the working day, but not the hour it starts. The report assumes 08:00 in the company's timezone and says so above — every finding here rests on that assumption until the field exists.",
  "securityReports.afterHours.gap.shifts": "Shifts",
