  "eta.filingScopeTitle": "What Mezan actually files",
  "eta.filingScope": "Mezan prepares your e-invoices and reports consumer e-receipts to the Tax Authority itself; B2B invoices are not filed to production until your own e-seal (a token or HSM you buy from an accredited provider) is connected through the signing agent, which is not yet shipped — until then every invoice shows «في انتظار الختم الإلكتروني» and is not considered filed.",
  "eta.receiptWindowHours": "E-receipt reporting window (hours)",
  "eta.receiptWindowHoursHint": "The authority's own POS FAQ states 24 hours from the sale; some vendors publish 72. Change it if your tax office tells you a different figure.",
  "eta.deviceSerialNumber": "POS device serial number",
  "eta.posClientId": "Device client id",
  "eta.branchDeviceHint": "The authority binds every e-receipt to the device registered for the branch. A branch with no serial cannot issue a receipt.",
  "eta.typeReceipt": "E-receipt",
  "nav.item.tax-simplified-regime": "Simplified tax regime",
  "nav.item.report-simplified-regime-comparison": "Simplified vs normal regime",
  "simplifiedRegime.title": "Simplified tax regime for small enterprises",
  "simplifiedRegime.subtitle": "Law 6/2025: tax on turnover rather than profit, for businesses whose annual turnover stays under EGP 20m. Record what you have already filed here, and read an indicative estimate of what it would cost.",
  "simplifiedRegime.estimateNotice": "Every figure on this page is an indicative estimate computed from your posted invoices — it is not a return and not an assessment. Review it with your chartered accountant before acting on it; the source of each number is printed beneath it.",
  "simplifiedRegime.api.loadFailed": "Could not load the simplified-regime record.",
  "simplifiedRegime.api.saveFailed": "Could not save the simplified-regime record.",
